WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:04.330
<b>That's right. The culprit...</b>

00:07.830 --> 00:09.000
<b>...is you!</b>

00:10.670 --> 00:11.710
<b>It wasn't me!</b>

00:11.710 --> 00:12.460
<b>Huh?</b>

00:13.630 --> 00:14.750
<b>Whoops!</b>

00:19.920 --> 00:20.830
<b>Which is it?</b>

00:21.080 --> 00:24.750
<b>The culprit... is him.</b>

00:43.290 --> 00:45.670
<b>Sousa ore wa mezamete shimatta</b>

00:45.670 --> 00:48.500
<b>Tokubetsu na chikara motte shimatta</b>

00:48.500 --> 00:50.670
<b>Kono barrier no maeni wa</b>

00:50.670 --> 00:55.130
<b>Donna yatsura mo muryoku daze</b>

00:58.210 --> 01:00.920
<b>Tenshi ka akuma no umarekawari ka</b>

01:00.920 --> 01:03.750
<b>Mienai mono ga miete shimaunda</b>

01:03.750 --> 01:05.960
<b>Migiude ga uzukidashita</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.330
<b>Kakusei no toki wa mada hayai</b>

01:08.460 --> 01:11.130
<b>Kodomo janaisi otona demo nai</b>

01:11.130 --> 01:13.460
<b>Tetsugaku pierce buchi akete</b>

01:13.460 --> 01:17.250
<b>Kashiore karaage lemon o kaketara saa!</b>

01:17.540 --> 01:19.830
<b>(Nonde nonde nonde nonde)</b>

01:20.000 --> 01:22.330
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:22.330 --> 01:24.830
<b>Kodoku to herikutsu no yami ni magirete</b>

01:24.830 --> 01:27.420
<b>Tokkouyaku wa mitsukaranai</b>

01:27.420 --> 01:29.790
<b>Otoko ni umareta shukumei dakara</b>

01:29.790 --> 01:32.580
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

01:32.580 --> 01:35.080
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

01:35.080 --> 01:37.500
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:37.500 --> 01:39.960
<b>Risou to genjitsu no hazama de yureteru</b>

01:39.960 --> 01:42.540
<b>Kaiketsusaku wa miataranai</b>

01:42.540 --> 01:45.130
<b>Setsuna o musaboru unmei naraba</b>

01:45.130 --> 01:47.750
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

01:47.920 --> 01:50.250
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

01:50.250 --> 01:52.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

01:58.790 --> 02:01.670
<b>Episode 2</b>

01:58.790 --> 02:01.670
<b>Perhaps the Reincarnation of an Angel or a Devil</b>

02:00.250 --> 02:02.040
<b>He's Sekiya, a third year.</b>

02:02.040 --> 02:05.750
<b>He's definitely the one who's
been messing with you, Hijiri-san.</b>

02:05.750 --> 02:07.040
<b>That's a lie!</b>

02:08.040 --> 02:11.460
<b>Th-that's right. I was just trying to trick him.</b>

02:11.830 --> 02:13.040
<b>That's a total lie.</b>

02:13.670 --> 02:17.380
<b>Remember our eyes met? Back there?</b>

02:18.000 --> 02:19.670
<b>Th-this...</b>

02:30.080 --> 02:30.920
<b>Are you...</b>

02:32.000 --> 02:35.040
<b>...still going to insist I'm lying?</b>

02:37.420 --> 02:39.960
<b>Looks like the sand weights are broken.</b>

02:39.960 --> 02:42.630
<b>Keep back so you don't get hurt, everyone!</b>

02:42.630 --> 02:44.080
<b>Okay.</b>

02:55.460 --> 02:56.750
<b>All right, begin!</b>

02:57.170 --> 03:00.750
<b>So you're sure that guy's the culprit?</b>

03:04.290 --> 03:08.130
<b>But no one was around when
the basketball hoop fell over.</b>

03:10.830 --> 03:13.040
<b>Then why would it fall over?</b>

03:15.000 --> 03:18.210
<b>If the weights were broken,
it must've been that gust of wind.</b>

03:18.540 --> 03:20.380
<b>Then what about that thing?</b>

03:21.250 --> 03:22.790
<b>The toy bird.</b>

03:27.290 --> 03:29.460
<b>The cockatrice garuda...</b>

03:34.290 --> 03:40.500
<b>Just before that bird came flying,
Sekiya-senpai passed behind Nakamura, right?</b>

03:43.790 --> 03:46.290
<b>You should tell us that kind of thing earlier!</b>

03:46.290 --> 03:51.710
<b>Uhh? He's been hanging around our classroom
a lot recently, so I didn't think it was too weird.</b>

03:51.880 --> 03:53.790
<b>What? For quite some time?</b>

03:53.790 --> 03:55.250
<b>Yup, for a while.</b>

03:56.380 --> 04:02.380
<b>But I just transferred here. It doesn't make sense
that he's been lurking around before that, does it?</b>

04:02.380 --> 04:03.210
<b>Oh!</b>

04:03.630 --> 04:04.960
<b>Oh, dear...</b>

04:04.960 --> 04:06.040
<b>What's wrong?</b>

04:06.290 --> 04:07.920
<b>Oh, well...</b>

04:08.420 --> 04:13.960
<b>Last month, Sekiya-senpai asked me to go out with him...</b>

04:13.960 --> 04:15.750
<b>What?!</b>

04:16.130 --> 04:17.960
<b>A-and what did you tell him?</b>

04:18.380 --> 04:21.580
<b>I rejected him. That I needed time to think.</b>

04:22.460 --> 04:26.250
<b>You didn't reject him at all! You just put the answer off!</b>

04:26.580 --> 04:30.460
<b>So Sekiya-senpai was hanging around
because he wanted an answer.</b>

04:31.080 --> 04:36.420
<b>But then, a sudden transfer student was
getting all friendly with Watase.</b>

04:37.080 --> 04:39.170
<b>That must have annoyed Sekiya.</b>

04:39.170 --> 04:42.130
<b>Wait, that's no reason to take it out on me!</b>

04:42.540 --> 04:47.830
<b>He was the one who confessed his feelings,
so seeing Mizuki Hijiri get intimate with Nanako Watase</b>

04:47.830 --> 04:52.540
<b>must have made his flames of
hatred flare up like the fires of hell.</b>

04:54.080 --> 04:56.670
<b>So he threw stuff at me?
What is he, in elementary school?!</b>

04:56.960 --> 04:59.580
<b>Do you think this will keep happening?</b>

04:59.920 --> 05:02.540
<b>Those kinds of idiots just keep escalating their behavior.</b>

05:03.080 --> 05:05.290
<b>I can't deal with that!</b>

05:05.630 --> 05:06.790
<b>Then I have a plan-</b>

05:08.380 --> 05:11.080
<b>Shh. The enemy's still lurking.</b>

05:13.710 --> 05:16.000
<b>Whoa, he's really staring at us.</b>

05:17.080 --> 05:18.250
<b>Shall we go to the room?</b>

05:18.250 --> 05:19.960
<b>He'll definitely follow us.</b>

05:19.960 --> 05:21.920
<b>Then I know the perfect place.</b>

05:25.540 --> 05:28.290
<b>Nakamura</b>

05:26.630 --> 05:28.290
<b>Black's house!</b>

05:28.790 --> 05:33.290
<b>Look! This one's Excalibur! Awesome, huh?!</b>

05:33.500 --> 05:35.830
<b>You just wanted to come here!</b>

05:36.210 --> 05:41.920
<b>But yeah, your room's... really something, Nakamura-kun.</b>

05:43.920 --> 05:48.080
<b>The blade of the holy sword Excalibur purges all evil.</b>

05:48.080 --> 05:50.790
<b>You'd best be careful it doesn't disintegrate you all.</b>

05:51.330 --> 05:53.670
<b>Nakamura-kun seems to be in a good mood.</b>

05:53.670 --> 05:56.080
<b>He's probably really proud of his collection.</b>

05:56.750 --> 05:58.080
<b>The time has come!</b>

05:58.920 --> 06:00.540
<b>It's a parakeet.</b>

06:00.540 --> 06:02.420
<b>What a pretty blue!</b>

06:02.830 --> 06:05.040
<b>Oh, does he interest you?</b>

06:05.380 --> 06:08.830
<b>Then allow me to introduce
my sworn ally from my previous life!</b>

06:09.500 --> 06:11.460
<b>Come forth, Faust!</b>

06:14.540 --> 06:15.580
<b>You okay?</b>

06:15.920 --> 06:22.290
<b>I-it's a blood pact. After all, he's descended
from the red crimson phoenix...</b>

06:22.580 --> 06:23.830
<b>Even though he's blue?</b>

06:23.830 --> 06:27.170
<b>Fool, the flames of the demon realm
can be blue at times!</b>

06:27.250 --> 06:29.710
<b>Quiet, imbecile. Quiet, imbecile.</b>

06:29.710 --> 06:32.130
<b>He really takes after his owner's tastes...</b>

06:35.380 --> 06:36.830
<b>I'll make us some tea.</b>

06:37.830 --> 06:41.460
<b>Well... his bookshelf's something, too...</b>

06:41.460 --> 06:45.290
<b>He must love books.
Look at all these difficult-looking titles.</b>

06:45.790 --> 06:47.540
<b>I bet he just bought ones with cool titles.</b>

06:47.960 --> 06:50.750
<b>Um, and what are you doing?</b>

06:52.040 --> 06:53.500
<b>A house search.</b>

06:54.290 --> 06:56.380
<b>That's not right.</b>

06:56.380 --> 06:57.460
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:57.880 --> 07:01.380
<b>This is the kind of place
you'd find some interesting stuff-</b>

07:01.630 --> 07:02.460
<b>Got something!</b>

07:04.420 --> 07:05.960
<b>Wait, what is this?</b>

07:06.710 --> 07:09.960
<b>"Revelations of a Wretched Fallen Angel"?</b>

07:10.500 --> 07:12.960
<b>Wait. It says something below that.</b>

07:14.460 --> 07:17.710
<b>"Lost child apocalypse"?</b>

07:18.210 --> 07:21.420
<b>So "Revelations of a Wretched Fallen Angel"...</b>

07:21.420 --> 07:24.500
<b>...is supposed to be read "Lost Child Apocalypse?!"</b>

07:31.170 --> 07:34.460
<b>"The human whose name is written
in this notebook shall die."</b>

07:34.460 --> 07:37.290
<b>Uh, that sounds awfully familiar!</b>

07:38.750 --> 07:40.000
<b>What about that one?</b>

07:40.460 --> 07:43.250
<b>"The Savior of Light and Darkness, Messiah-"</b>

07:43.250 --> 07:47.250
<b>"Episode of the Black Lily Catastrophe: World Origins"...</b>

07:47.750 --> 07:50.750
<b>I-is that whole thing the title...?</b>

07:50.750 --> 07:51.960
<b>What's on the next page?</b>

07:53.130 --> 07:58.750
<b>"My name is Toga Ryushoin,
but people call me 'Jet Black Lightning.'"</b>

07:56.750 --> 07:58.750
<b>So this...</b>

07:56.750 --> 07:58.750
<b>is Valbaras...</b>

08:00.080 --> 08:01.580
<b>Don't tell me Nakamura...</b>

08:01.580 --> 08:04.250
<b>He's writing a manga starring himself?!</b>

08:04.250 --> 08:06.290
<b>Yikes, that’s way too cringeworthy...</b>

08:06.500 --> 08:08.380
<b>He's good at drawing, though.</b>

08:09.420 --> 08:12.500
<b>Dang, I'm scared to look but I can't stop!</b>

08:14.880 --> 08:17.040
<b>Th-this...!</b>

08:17.290 --> 08:20.790
<b>Afterword</b>

08:18.080 --> 08:19.880
<b>I-it's an afterword...!</b>

08:21.290 --> 08:24.290
<b>"Should I say, 'Nice to meet you'?"</b>

08:24.290 --> 08:28.460
<b>Or perhaps I should say..."we meet again."</b>

08:28.880 --> 08:34.920
<b>All living things submit to the laws of reincarnation,
to the great circle of ouroboros.</b>

08:35.250 --> 08:37.830
<b>That is my doctrine, my philosophia...</b>

08:38.210 --> 08:39.790
<b>I have yet to introduce myself.</b>

08:40.920 --> 08:44.330
<b>"I am the Creator of this World..."</b>

08:44.330 --> 08:47.880
<b>Toga Ryushoin. Toga Ryushoin!</b>

08:48.500 --> 08:51.630
<b>So he's the Creator!</b>

08:51.630 --> 08:54.330
<b>Shoot, I'm actually liking this.</b>

08:56.830 --> 08:57.960
<b>Could you open the door?</b>

09:05.130 --> 09:09.540
<b>Rejoice. I found some quality
red holy water, the rot elixier.</b>

09:09.670 --> 09:12.830
<b>Oh that's great. I was so thirsty.</b>

09:12.830 --> 09:16.330
<b>Oh thanks. I really needed to restore my HP.</b>

09:16.580 --> 09:18.830
<b>Really? That's good to hear.</b>

09:21.250 --> 09:22.920
<b>My conscience hurts!</b>

09:26.040 --> 09:27.670
<b>That's really nice.</b>

09:27.670 --> 09:33.000
<b>Wait, we can't be drinking tea like this!
We have to make Sekiya-senpai stop hanging around!</b>

09:33.250 --> 09:35.500
<b>You have a plan, right Yellow?</b>

09:35.920 --> 09:37.000
<b>Kinda, yeah.</b>

09:38.790 --> 09:40.750
<b>You just need a boyfriend.</b>

09:41.210 --> 09:45.710
<b>I'm... really not interested in that kind of thing yet...</b>

09:46.250 --> 09:48.500
<b>No, I mean a pretend one!</b>

09:48.500 --> 09:52.080
<b>I see. So we'll have someone pretend
to be her boyfriend.</b>

09:52.080 --> 09:53.210
<b>Ah, okay.</b>

09:53.210 --> 09:56.710
<b>There was this special iLive event the other day.</b>

09:56.710 --> 09:58.580
<b>Ah, that game again.</b>

09:59.000 --> 10:00.960
<b>I wish you could've seen it!</b>

10:01.540 --> 10:07.790
<b>The moment when my love for Sora-chan banished
the stalker scum to the pits of defeat!</b>

10:08.210 --> 10:09.750
<b>I think it's a good idea.</b>

10:10.080 --> 10:13.670
<b>But... I don't have anyone I could ask...</b>

10:15.080 --> 10:17.170
<b>This is a job for the Hero Club!</b>

10:17.460 --> 10:20.790
<b>Not you, Noda-kun. You'll probably give it away, right?</b>

10:21.330 --> 10:25.130
<b>Isn't this where the pretty boy should come in?</b>

10:25.460 --> 10:26.960
<b>"Pretty boy," huh...?</b>

10:28.540 --> 10:31.290
<b>M-m-me, a boyfriend?!</b>

10:31.540 --> 10:34.040
<b>Well yeah, I do go on dates every day...!</b>

10:34.040 --> 10:35.380
<b>You mean in your game.</b>

10:35.630 --> 10:38.250
<b>And sure, I have hundreds of girlfriends...</b>

10:38.420 --> 10:39.750
<b>All 2D.</b>

10:39.750 --> 10:43.080
<b>Pretending to be a boyfriend would be super eas-!</b>

10:44.960 --> 10:46.580
<b>Get a hold of yourself, Yellow!</b>

10:46.580 --> 10:49.580
<b>This is bad! An evil spirit must have taken over!</b>

10:49.580 --> 10:53.330
<b>Begone, evil spirit! Begone, evil spirit!
Begone, evil spirit! Begone, evil spirit!</b>

10:54.130 --> 10:55.290
<b>What a dork!</b>

10:55.290 --> 10:57.080
<b>Watase-san, who do you want to ask?</b>

10:57.080 --> 11:00.750
<b>Um, well... This is tough...</b>

11:00.750 --> 11:02.040
<b>Of course it is...</b>

11:02.330 --> 11:05.420
<b>Begone! Evil spirit!</b>

11:07.130 --> 11:08.170
<b>I've decided!</b>

11:08.170 --> 11:09.130
<b>Huh?</b>

11:10.210 --> 11:13.500
<b>Nakamura-kun, can I ask you?</b>

11:14.130 --> 11:16.880
<b>Wait, I lost to Nakamura? What?</b>

11:17.920 --> 11:19.710
<b>That's... unexpected.</b>

11:20.250 --> 11:25.330
<b>Well, I thought he's a nice person for taking
such good care of Takashima-kun.</b>

11:25.330 --> 11:26.630
<b>All he did was slap him!</b>

11:26.630 --> 11:33.250
<b>Well, woman. If you've seen the gleam of my soul,
blessed by Heaven itself, I'm impressed.</b>

11:33.790 --> 11:39.790
<b>Abandoning a helpless lamb plagued by the distortion
in this world goes against my ideology.</b>

11:40.790 --> 11:43.170
<b>I lost to something-Ryushoin...</b>

11:45.630 --> 11:48.290
<b>It can't hurt to have an occasional diversion.</b>

11:49.210 --> 11:50.290
<b>Sekiya, you fiend.</b>

11:52.420 --> 11:54.250
<b>Prepare yourself!</b>

11:55.040 --> 11:57.040
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys.</b>

11:58.710 --> 12:00.500
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys.</b>

12:08.670 --> 12:12.420
<b>You contacted me because
you've made your decision, right?</b>

12:12.830 --> 12:14.960
<b>Uh, yes. Actually...</b>

12:16.380 --> 12:19.380
<b>We need him to give up on Watase-san.</b>

12:19.380 --> 12:21.920
<b>So how come Nakamura's late?</b>

12:22.460 --> 12:26.080
<b>I don't care, just come already!
It's just the two of them now!</b>

12:26.540 --> 12:28.130
<b>You'll go out with me, right?</b>

12:28.500 --> 12:32.630
<b>Actually, I-I'm already going out with someone else...</b>

12:34.130 --> 12:37.040
<b>That's a lie. You're not really, are you?</b>

12:39.830 --> 12:41.080
<b>Sorry for the wait.</b>

12:42.790 --> 12:46.210
<b>The memories of war torment me nightly...</b>

12:46.540 --> 12:53.330
<b>This downpour may come from my bottomless feelings
of regret, the rains of my lament...</b>

12:55.130 --> 12:55.880
<b>What?</b>

12:57.540 --> 13:02.540
<b>It's only fitting for a man covered in sin
to get pelted by the rain...</b>

13:04.420 --> 13:05.210
<b>Huh?</b>

13:09.000 --> 13:10.330
<b>What the heck was that?</b>

13:10.630 --> 13:15.210
<b>Don't tell me that's Nakamura-kun's idea of a cool guy?</b>

13:15.210 --> 13:18.580
<b>Black... Where's Excalibur...?!</b>

13:18.580 --> 13:19.380
<b>What?!</b>

13:19.670 --> 13:21.630
<b>Nakamura-kun, here's an umbrella!</b>

13:27.040 --> 13:28.040
<b>Where'd he go?!</b>

13:28.580 --> 13:29.500
<b>Over here.</b>

13:34.750 --> 13:37.790
<b>My name is Toga Ryushoin.</b>

13:38.380 --> 13:42.040
<b>Isn't it Nakamura?
The brainiac who got in with top grades.</b>

13:42.420 --> 13:49.170
<b>That's merely an alias given to the temporary form
I occupy in this worldline for convenience's sake.</b>

13:49.750 --> 13:50.670
<b>Uh...?</b>

13:52.830 --> 13:56.920
<b>Let's buy you some clothes inside.
You'll catch a cold if you stay soaked in this uniform.</b>

13:57.250 --> 14:03.290
<b>Well, although I hesitate to remove
my restrictive gear outside of my power barrier,</b>

14:03.630 --> 14:05.130
<b>I suppose I have no choice.</b>

14:06.170 --> 14:09.420
<b>I shall focus my energy on controlling my powers.</b>

14:11.460 --> 14:12.210
<b>Um...</b>

14:16.630 --> 14:19.080
<b>Nakamura-kun, what kind of clothes do you want?</b>

14:19.500 --> 14:24.920
<b>Ordinarily, I don holy garments that have magic woven in</b>

14:23.420 --> 14:32.210
<b>Mother</b>

14:24.920 --> 14:27.380
<b>or have been offered to me by
a blood relation from my current life.</b>

14:27.380 --> 14:30.500
<b>Your mom usually buys your clothes for you, huh?</b>

14:30.500 --> 14:32.250
<b>How did she decipher that?!</b>

14:46.670 --> 14:48.670
<b>Is this weirding him out?</b>

14:54.130 --> 14:55.710
<b>It's totally weirding him out!</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:03.790
<b>Enrobing myself in jet black gives the hollow emptiness
of my soul some semblance of tranquility...</b>

15:04.250 --> 15:07.040
<b>A world of vibrance is too bright for my existence.</b>

15:07.960 --> 15:14.630
<b>Or perhaps it's because of Gildivalan,
the dark deity sealed within this right arm of mine...!</b>

15:14.710 --> 15:17.330
<b>Yup, black looks the best on you.</b>

15:18.790 --> 15:20.210
<b>He's speechless!</b>

15:20.540 --> 15:23.210
<b>Finish him off, Black!</b>

15:29.250 --> 15:35.580
<b>Let's cut to the chase. I want you to stop
haunting Nanako Watase like some ghoul.</b>

15:36.290 --> 15:37.080
<b>What?</b>

15:38.500 --> 15:40.960
<b>This woman's name was Rosary in a former life.</b>

15:41.250 --> 15:44.920
<b>She's my soulmate, a fact carved
into the Akashic records.</b>

15:45.250 --> 15:47.080
<b>Rosa... what?</b>

15:47.460 --> 15:49.250
<b>May I take your order?</b>

15:49.250 --> 15:51.420
<b>Can I get an ice cream soda, please?</b>

15:51.670 --> 15:55.920
<b>Rosary Rosaria.
The kindhearted daughter of a blacksmith,</b>

15:55.920 --> 16:00.460
<b>but actually the reincarnation of Jabra'il,
one of the four archangels.</b>

16:01.000 --> 16:04.580
<b>Her golden hair trailing in the wind
was like an ocean of rich grain,</b>

16:04.580 --> 16:07.750
<b>and her eyes, filled with
the deepest sorrow and compassion,</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:10.920
<b>were adorned with irises like
the stars sparkling in the Milky Way.</b>

16:13.040 --> 16:14.670
<b>And what about you, sir?</b>

16:15.380 --> 16:16.330
<b>Sir?</b>

16:16.580 --> 16:18.750
<b>Huh? Oh, coke.</b>

16:18.750 --> 16:21.460
<b>Dark matter, hmm? Not bad.</b>

16:21.460 --> 16:26.210
<b>Then I shall have the droplets of
pure black, a blend of schwarz drops.</b>

16:26.210 --> 16:29.380
<b>Accompanied by Alpen heights soaked
in crimson, the Bloody Mont-</b>

16:29.380 --> 16:32.290
<b>One coffee with a strawberry Mont Blanc cake.</b>

16:32.290 --> 16:35.000
<b>That server understands him, too?!</b>

16:36.880 --> 16:42.630
<b>That sweet memory of us swearing our love for
each other at the foot of the world tree Yggdrasill</b>

16:42.630 --> 16:46.330
<b>still lights my bleak soul with a certain warmth...</b>

16:46.880 --> 16:51.580
<b>With every reincarnation we were torn apart by cruel fate,</b>

16:52.380 --> 16:58.330
<b>but we still keep reuniting,
drawn to each other as if guided by some power.</b>

16:58.710 --> 17:00.580
<b>Nakamura-kun's on a roll.</b>

17:01.880 --> 17:03.750
<b>Oh, Sekiya got up.</b>

17:05.670 --> 17:06.920
<b>Is he going to the bathroom?</b>

17:08.500 --> 17:09.580
<b>You too?</b>

17:10.790 --> 17:12.380
<b>I drank a bit too much.</b>

17:33.330 --> 17:37.750
<b>I don't recommend standing behind me. It's dangerous.</b>

17:44.250 --> 17:45.750
<b>No more games.</b>

17:46.040 --> 17:50.750
<b>Based on what I've seen since the school year started,
from good morning to getting home,</b>

17:50.960 --> 17:54.170
<b>I've never seen any guy around Watase.</b>

17:54.920 --> 17:57.330
<b>He's a stalker for real!</b>

17:58.330 --> 18:00.170
<b>"Since the school year started"...?</b>

18:00.880 --> 18:02.080
<b>Let's get him!</b>

18:02.080 --> 18:02.630
<b>Shh!</b>

18:03.130 --> 18:06.500
<b>When did the two of you ever get together?</b>

18:12.500 --> 18:13.330
<b>Here.</b>

18:13.330 --> 18:17.880
<b>Apologies, Rosary. This must be the doing
of that demon I defeated before this.</b>

18:18.420 --> 18:23.750
<b>How careless of me.
I didn't even realize the curse it left on me.</b>

18:24.170 --> 18:25.500
<b>Sounds bad.</b>

18:25.500 --> 18:32.380
<b>Not to worry, Rosary. The soothing melody of
the Healing Lullaby should restore me instantly.</b>

18:34.130 --> 18:34.880
<b>What?!</b>

18:35.420 --> 18:38.710
<b>Hold on. I might have that with me.</b>

18:39.290 --> 18:40.250
<b>I do.</b>

18:40.540 --> 18:43.540
<b>Cold Medication</b>

18:40.580 --> 18:43.170
<b>There, "Healing Lullaby"?</b>

18:46.290 --> 18:47.250
<b>You're kidding?!</b>

18:56.420 --> 19:01.040
<b>What is this noisy buzzing and
the severe chills running down my back?!</b>

19:01.040 --> 19:04.420
<b>No! How could the Healing Lullaby not work?!</b>

19:07.330 --> 19:15.670
<b>Impossible! Is the seal on the dark deity Gildivalan
in my right arm threatening to break?!</b>

19:17.540 --> 19:18.750
<b>There's no time!</b>

19:20.170 --> 19:21.880
<b>Th-that's...!</b>

19:23.170 --> 19:27.130
<b>The Lost Child Apocalypse!</b>

19:37.710 --> 19:42.790
<b>In short...if you lurk around Rosary any longer,</b>

19:43.080 --> 19:50.210
<b>I must write your name down in the Revelations of
a Wretched Fallen Angel, the Lost Child Apocalypse.</b>

19:53.080 --> 19:55.580
<b>I can't... keep up...</b>

19:57.670 --> 19:58.630
<b>Yes!</b>

20:09.130 --> 20:14.670
<b>Thank you, Nakamura-kun.
Sekiya-senpai hasn't been around at all since.</b>

20:15.540 --> 20:17.420
<b>No need to thank me.</b>

20:18.250 --> 20:19.670
<b>You too, Hijiri-san.</b>

20:20.540 --> 20:23.880
<b>I was just watching from the shadows.</b>

20:23.880 --> 20:26.830
<b>But you really gave me courage.</b>

20:27.880 --> 20:29.210
<b>So thanks.</b>

20:31.880 --> 20:34.670
<b>I'm so glad we manage to protect this smile!</b>

20:35.290 --> 20:41.540
<b>So anyway, I was hoping
we could be friends, Hijiri-san.</b>

20:43.630 --> 20:46.710
<b>I'd love to. Thanks, Watase-san.</b>

20:47.540 --> 20:48.790
<b>Nanako's fine.</b>

20:48.920 --> 20:51.080
<b>Then call me Mizuki.</b>

20:51.080 --> 20:53.040
<b>Okay, Mizuki-chan.</b>

20:53.250 --> 20:56.380
<b>Yes! I made a friend!</b>

20:56.790 --> 20:58.290
<b>Good for you, Pink!</b>

20:58.630 --> 21:02.880
<b>You got a friend and got rid of the stalker!
Both missions complete!</b>

21:03.250 --> 21:05.920
<b>Come on baby, I'll hold you in a clever embrace.</b>

21:06.710 --> 21:09.880
<b>No! Another bust!</b>

21:10.500 --> 21:14.040
<b>You're totally part of their gang now, huh?</b>

21:14.670 --> 21:17.290
<b>So you joined the Hero Club, Mizuki-chan?</b>

21:17.290 --> 21:20.130
<b>No, I didn't and I don't plan to.</b>

21:21.080 --> 21:22.420
<b>You can have this.</b>

21:22.880 --> 21:26.790
<b>"Hero Ticket, valid anytime, anywhere?"</b>

21:26.790 --> 21:29.000
<b>The Agency is after you, Pink.</b>

21:29.000 --> 21:30.210
<b>No one's after me.</b>

21:31.040 --> 21:32.790
<b>Use this when you need it!</b>

21:33.380 --> 21:37.670
<b>Whenever you call, we'll definitely
be there, anytime, anywhere!</b>

21:38.000 --> 21:44.130
<b>Fine, fine. I'm planning to enjoy
a quiet school life from here on out.</b>

21:44.130 --> 21:45.170
<b>So I don't-</b>

21:51.130 --> 21:54.170
<b>Seriously... What is up with that guy?</b>

22:04.130 --> 22:08.670
<b>Azayaka na melody kisetsu no kaze o matoi</b>

22:08.670 --> 22:11.750
<b>Boku o yonderu</b>

22:12.000 --> 22:19.210
<b>Afuredasu rhythm kutsuoto mo kasoku shite</b>

22:19.630 --> 22:27.460
<b>Utsumuiteru dakeja tsukamenai nanika sagashi ni yukou</b>

22:27.630 --> 22:37.710
<b>Donna takai kabe demo kimi to yukunara kitto toberu sa</b>

22:38.130 --> 22:40.420
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.750 --> 22:44.670
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.670 --> 22:47.880
<b>Egaita sono tsubasa de</b>

22:47.880 --> 22:51.670
<b>Keep flying and to story</b>

22:51.920 --> 22:56.540
<b>Ashita o kakeru kara</b>

22:56.540 --> 23:00.670
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.670 --> 23:04.000
<b>Kienai sono kodou wa</b>

23:04.000 --> 23:07.920
<b>Keep trying and to story</b>

23:07.920 --> 23:11.580
<b>Kasanaru harmony</b>

23:11.750 --> 23:17.380
<b>Dare no mono demonai miraizu wa</b>

23:17.750 --> 23:22.750
<b>Kimi to tsuzutteku</b>

23:26.830 --> 23:29.670
<b>Apparently Purple never has to wait for traffic lights.</b>

23:26.830 --> 23:29.080
<b>The time hath come to open the curtains...</b>

23:27.790 --> 23:30.000
<b>Next episode preview time.</b>

23:29.670 --> 23:32.500
<b>He has the power to manipulate time, I see.</b>

23:32.500 --> 23:35.630
<b>I've heard that in his presence,
everything goes on discount.</b>

23:33.580 --> 23:35.210
<b>150 yen off</b>

23:34.420 --> 23:36.170
<b>Basically free!</b>

23:35.630 --> 23:37.460
<b>Y-you're joking...!</b>

23:35.630 --> 23:38.420
<b>A steal at 2,499 yen!</b>

23:37.710 --> 23:40.540
<b>Next episode: "Neither a Kid nor an Adult."</b>
